{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29411","headline":"武侯庙古柏 · 李商隐","name":"武侯庙古柏","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"蜀相阶前柏，龙蛇捧閟宫。\n阴成外江畔，老向惠陵东。\n大树思冯异，甘棠忆召公。\n叶凋湘燕雨，枝拆海鹏风。\n玉垒经纶远，金刀历数终。\n谁将出师表，一爲问昭融。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李商隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29411.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29411","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}